/E (MIT World Peace University \(MIT-WPU\), Pune, was founded by visionary educationist Prof. Dr. Vishwanath D. Karad to provide quality higher education. Beginning with Maharashtra Institute of Technology \(MIT\) in 1983, it established itself in engineering and later expanded into multiple disciplines. Today, the MIT Group has grown to 5 universities and 80 institutions, serving over 70,000 students across Maharashtra.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
