/T (HackMIT-WPU 2025, our annual hackathon, is a gateway to transforming your ideas into tangible realities. We aim to ignite potential and equip the students with the necessary skills to become a future leader and entrepreneur. Through collaborative teamwork, expert guidance, and a stimulating environment, the students will be challenged to think critically, develop innovative solutions, and translate your vision into a concrete product. HackMIT-WPU 2025 is not just a competition; it's a springboard for the entrepreneurial journey, equipping the students with the skills and confidence to become a leader who shapes the future.)
/E (HackMIT-WPU 2025, our annual hackathon, is a gateway to transforming your ideas into tangible realities. We aim to ignite potential and equip the students with the necessary skills to become a future leader and entrepreneur. Through collaborative teamwork, expert guidance, and a stimulating environment, the students will be challenged to think critically, develop innovative solutions, and translate your vision into a concrete product. HackMIT-WPU 2025 is not just a competition; it's a springboard for the entrepreneurial journey, equipping the students with the skills and confidence to become a leader who shapes the future.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
