/T (Dr. Ashok Joshi began his career as an engineer at Ceramatec Inc., USA, in 1984 and became CEO in 1996. He navigated a potential sell-off due to a no-confidence motion and, in 1999, became the owner of Ceramatec Inc. Under his leadership, the company experienced a 300% growth over 8 years and was eventually acquired by CoorsTek, the largest technical ceramics company globally. )
