<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Hackathon Secretariat is the central organizing team that drives some of the most prestigious and large-scale events at MIT-WPU. With a legacy of executing high-impact flagship events, including NSRTC, World Parliament, and Hack MIT- WPU 2024, the Secretariat is the powerhouse behind successful, innovation-driven experiences. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
792 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As the core coordinating body, the Secretariat ensures seamless planning, execution, and management of events that push boundaries in technology, entrepreneurship, and global discourse. Through strategic leadership, meticulous planning, and collaboration with university clubs and industry leaders, the team consistently delivers transformative events that inspire students, foster innovation, and position MIT-WPU as a leader in academic excellence.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
793 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For HACK MIT-WPU 2025, the Secretariat is taking it a step further by expanding the event to a university-wide scale, integrating diverse clubs and disciplines to create a hackathon like never before. The Hackathon Secretariat aims to create a benchmark event, offering all university clubs equal opportunities for hands-on experience in management and organization. This expansion aims to create a collaborative ecosystem where clubs can enhance their organizational capabilities, work alongside experienced mentors, and develop leadership and problem-solving skills that will prepare them for future professional endeavors. Join us as we redefine innovation, collaboration, and impact at HACK MIT-WPU 2025!)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
