978 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Laser Shot event involves teams competing to build a model that accurately directs a laser beam to hit a specified target. This event includes two rounds, design round and test round. In the initial phase teams draw a box number that assigns them specific materials and a problem statement related to the principles of optics, particularly using mirror and lens formulas. They are given a time limit to construct their models, which must adhere to certain target details and possible restrictions. Teams that successfully complete their models within the allotted time qualify for the test round.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
